d_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-13.1","local_name":"bob-cli-13.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-13","agent_clan_generation":"20260824150210","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-13.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-13[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Free the @@ global destination from the header line and teach it to[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]absorb[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A `@@route` / `@@route+block-id` global destination declaration can[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]be typed on any line of any capture item instead of only on a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]header line, and typing a bare `@@` inside an item that already [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]carries a `@file` reference moves that reference onto the `@@` and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]deletes the original, so a draft can never end up with a shadowed [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]local marker or two competing declarations.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_global_destination_anywhere.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-13[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-13/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Position-free @@ declarations in the capture grammar[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: make any `@@…` token a global destination declaration anywhere [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in a draft, drop the header-line-only restriction, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicate-declaration and shadowed-local diagnostics, and update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture, capture-parse, capture-complete, help text, docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture-rewrite and the bare @@ absorption rule[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]rewrite[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite: add the `bob capture-rewrite` subcommand that turns a bare `@@`[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into `@@<payload>` by absorbing the item's local destination marker (or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the draft's other declaration), deleting the source token and returning [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]edits, cursor, and a human summary.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac capture panel absorbs @@ as you type[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]macapp[dim] · [dim][/dim]after rewrite[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]macapp: wire the bob-mac-capture panel to `bob capture-rewrite` so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typing a bare `@@` rewrites the draft in place with an announced [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]summary, plus CaptureCore models, process-client lane, tests, and README[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]updates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-13","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-13.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d5e3e48423a3a3098a65be4a893c048c","started_at":"2026-08-24T19:03:20.501723+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1787602436,"sha":"164ae386b3e06e57a7a6387cfca9ba66fb06ab8b","subject":"docs(c